Own ChromaDB directory. Code is chunked by function and class with each
file's import edges (after evaluation/repo_graph.py, re-implemented);
commits one chunk per commit per file with the diff. Embeddings are
local nomic-embed-text with search_document:/search_query: prefixes;
if Ollama is unreachable callers fall back to lexical ranking.

